### 사진 두 장 올리기
# @name uploaded
POST http://localhost:4012/api/uploads
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=photo-boundary

--photo-boundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="images"; filename="beach.jpg"
Content-Type: image/jpeg

< ../../requests/photos/beach.jpg
--photo-boundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="images"; filename="forest.jpg"
Content-Type: image/jpeg

< ../../requests/photos/forest.jpg
--photo-boundary--

### 첫 사진만 써서 게시물 만들기
POST http://localhost:4012/api/posts
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "imageUrls": ["{{uploaded.imageUrls[0]}}"]
}

### 곧바로 청소
DELETE http://localhost:4012/api/uploads/orphans

### 30초 기다린 뒤 청소
DELETE http://localhost:4012/api/uploads/orphans

### 게시물 사진 열기
GET http://localhost:4012{{uploaded.imageUrls[0]}}

### 안 쓴 사진 열기
GET http://localhost:4012{{uploaded.imageUrls[1]}}
